# QA Assessment Context

- Application Under Test: https://practicesoftwaretesting.com/
- API Documentation: https://api.practicesoftwaretesting.com/api/documentation
- Framework: Playwright (Prism Framework) under PrismStructure/
- Test scope: Manual (CSV), UI automation, API automation
- Tags: @Smoke, @Regression
- Max 5-8 test cases per type (manual, UI, API)
- Invoice generation requires pressing confirm button twice (UI); API uses /payment/check then /invoices
- Follow iterative development with incremental git commits
- Do not invent folders outside the assignment structure
- Do not commit secrets, tokens, or real credentials
